三次元かっこ立体におき換えて AB間の距離を求めよ
Converting to 3D space, find the distance between A and B

583
00:38:16,156 --> 00:38:18,456
好きな感じだと思ってたのに
Even though I thought it was my type

584
00:38:18,456 --> 00:38:20,356
予想もかすりもし見当たらないし
My expectations didn't hit the mark at all

585
00:38:20,356 --> 00:38:22,356
参考資料にも乗っていないから
It's not even in the reference materials

586
00:38:22,356 --> 00:38:25,256
君と見いだして見せたいよ 三次元かっこ世界の
I want you and me to find out how to measure our feelings in this 3D world

587
00:38:53,056 --> 00:38:56,056
チューリングラブ 見つめあったって君にメロバ
Turing love! Staring at one another makes it all mellow

588
00:38:56,056 --> 00:38:59,056
ワットイズラブ いま 3D であかそうか
What is love? Now, on 3D proving with what we know!

589
00:39:00,056 --> 00:39:02,056
言葉で生み出すクエスト ハートで高鳴るアンサー
Words that'll generate a question, my heart's yearning for an answer

590
